0x1440.png", "id": "1045066897863273", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310646_1045066901196606_9116653998931619767_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=36mOzgfewHwQ7kNvwH_S2z9&_nc_oc=AdqqGXgwvj9uRYd3VF5dF5pfpgVrJpRQctatgyRxyn3mDmCgW1WmNcmf016AWX1KhLE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLjr7uR7cZfPD4ykeAoveTknbUkmSF2JgtkNKq34OsATA&oe=6A9FFC65"}, "display_name": "FunnyLand: Amusement park", "keywords": ["rollercoaster", "amusementpark", "themepark", "thrillrides", "vrrides"], "long_description": "**Welcome to FunnyLand, a colorful virtual reality amusement park packed with rides, attractions, and unique ways to explore.**\n\nTake on thrilling experiences such as the **Roller Coaster, Kamikaze, Pirate Ship, Booster, Top Scan, Octopus,** and **Haunted House**. You can also enjoy classic attractions like the **Ferris Wheel, Balloon Ride, Flying Circus, Free Fall,** and even a fully playable **bowling alley**.\n\nThanks to virtual reality, you are not simply watching the rides\u2014you are right in the middle of the action. Explore the park at your own pace, choose your favorite attractions, and experience every twist, drop, and turn from an immersive first-person perspective.\n\n## **Available attractions**\n\n- **Condor**\n- **Kamikaze**\n- **Pirate Ship**\n- **Bowling**\n- **Ferris Wheel**\n- **Roller Coaster**\n- **Haunted House**\n- **Top Scan**\n- **Fly Away**\n- **Octopus**\n- **Booster**\n- **Flying Circus**\n- **Frisbee**\n- **Free Fall**\n- **Balloon Ride**\n\n## **Special ways to explore**\n\n- **Spider Hands:** Shoot webs and swing around the park like a superhero.\n- **Iron Hands:** Activate the thrusters in your hands and soar through the sky.\n\nWhether you are looking for intense thrills, relaxing rides, or the freedom to fly around the park, **FunnyLand offers a fun and varied VR amusement park experience.**", "short_description": "Welcome to FunnyLand, a colorful VR amusement park filled with exciting rides and attractions. Jump in, feel the thrills, and enjoy an unforgettable day of fun."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ippogames.com/PrivacyPolicy_palvesoft_mod.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "PalveSoft S.L.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ippogames.com/PrivacyPolicy_palvesoft_mod.html", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ROLLER_COASTER", "SIMULATION", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26111765635188725"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308063_2058259035062798_744824593526482656_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PShUko6wuN4Q7kNvwFCcKjo&_nc_oc=AdovTBrKNaLlcYTbpicfT_3sNsnHvvKZ9MdYx18Rhe12asqLhVxPzAsID2stW6sVKHs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ2Q0Ki5XFS6F18g7gIXtC8NIb_Fhfj-PEy8UkjOFaIjw&oe=6AA02D22"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "FunnyLand: Amusement park", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Simulation", "id": "331529188132278"}], "release_date": 1655311433, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "4117281321730472", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "a